# Metadata Conversion Issue

## Problem
- `streaming.Header` = `map[string]string`
- `streaming.Trailer` = `map[string]string`  
- `metadata.MD` = `map[string][]string`

Cannot directly convert between incompatible map types.

## Solution
Need helper functions to convert between single-value and multi-value metadata:

```go
// headerToMD converts Header to metadata.MD
func headerToMD(h Header) metadata.MD {
    md := metadata.MD{}
    for k, v := range h {
        md[k] = []string{v}
    }
    return md
}

// mdToHeader converts metadata.MD to Header (takes first value)
func mdToHeader(md metadata.MD) Header {
    h := Header{}
    for k, v := range md {
        if len(v) > 0 {
            h[k] = v[0]
        }
    }
    return h
}
```

## Next Steps
1. Add conversion functions to streaming.go
2. Update all adapter methods to use these converters
3. Verify build passes

